SUMMARY:Zac Townsend LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Zac Townsend\nZac Townsend is a Nashville-based comedian and writer who accidentally launched his stand-up career after engaging with Michael Blackson in an online roast battle so hard that Blackson invited him to his show and handed him a mic. Since then\, Zac has never looked back. He’s now a regular at Zanies Nashville and has opened for Shane Gillis\, Andrew Santino\, Joe List\, Doug Stanhope\, Big Jay Oakerson\, Jessica Kirson\, Steve-O\, and Earthquake. \nOff stage\, Zac co-created the viral sketch collective Paid Vacation\, which has amassed over 60 million views across TikTok and Instagram. You’ve also seen him on Barstool Sports\, at the Nashville Comedy Festival\, LMAOF TV\, and Bonnaroo. His Houston debut at Punch Line is one of the most exciting new bookings of the summer. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price: From $28 \nAbout Punch Line Houston\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located at 1204 Caroline Street. Part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this intimate venue delivers an up-close comedy experience that puts you right in the action. \nThe club features table seating\, a full-service bar\, and a two-drink minimum. The intimate setting is perfect for Zac’s sharp\, crowd-driven style. Parking is available in nearby downtown Houston garages. \nWhat to Expect\nZac Townsend’s live show is a high-energy\, laugh-packed set from one of comedy’s most exciting rising voices. He brings the same fearless energy that made his viral content explode online — raw\, unfiltered\, and consistently funny. Expect sharp observations\, crowd interaction\, and a room that’s fully locked in from start to finish. \nThis is a Thursday night show at Punch Line Houston on August 6 at 7:30 PM. This is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum per guest. Tickets are limited — grab yours early. \nTicket Information\nPrice: From $28\nTickets available via Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/zac-townsend-live-at-punch-line-houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/946/deafecf8-e4a5-49c9-90f3-b38615cec946_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg
GEO:29.7533552;-95.3641123
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Punch Line Houston 1204 Caroline Street Houston TX 77002 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1204 Caroline Street:geo:-95.3641123,29.7533552
END:VEVENT
