SUMMARY:Craig Robinson LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Craig Robinson\nCraig Robinson is one of the most versatile entertainers in Hollywood — a comedian\, actor\, and musician whose talent knows no bounds. Best known for his beloved role as Darryl Philbin on NBC’s “The Office\,” Craig has also starred in blockbuster films including “Pineapple Express\,” “Hot Tub Time Machine\,” “Knocked Up\,” and “This Is the End.” \nCraig’s live stand-up show is a unique experience that blends sharp comedy with his prodigious keyboard skills. He weaves hilarious stories and observations with musical interludes\, creating a show that is unlike anything else in comedy. His authentic\, deadpan wit and genuine warmth make him a fan favorite wherever he performs. \nWith decades of experience in comedy clubs\, theaters\, and arenas\, Craig Robinson brings a polished\, high-energy performance to every stage. His ability to connect with audiences through both laughter and music makes his live show a truly unforgettable experience. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open one hour before the show) \nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825 \nAge Restriction: 18+ event. Two-beverage minimum per person. No re-entry. \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is one of the most iconic comedy venues on the West Coast\, located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, California. The intimate club seats approximately 300 guests in a tiered layout that ensures excellent sightlines from every seat in the house. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, with a two-beverage minimum per guest. The professional sound system and warm\, welcoming atmosphere make it the perfect setting for an evening of world-class entertainment. Parking is available in the surrounding area\, and the club is conveniently located near major Sacramento thoroughfares. \nPunch Line Sacramento has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and continues to be the premier destination for live stand-up in the Sacramento region. \nWhat to Expect\nCraig Robinson’s live show is a one-of-a-kind experience that blends stand-up comedy with live keyboard performances. Expect hilarious stories from his time on “The Office” and Hollywood\, sharp observational humor\, and spontaneous musical moments that will have the entire room singing along. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum. Craig is known for his genuine crowd engagement and his ability to make every audience member feel like part of the show. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $45 – $85 (includes fees) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale options through VividSeats. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
