SUMMARY:Gianmarco Soresi: The Drama King Tour LIVE at Hawaii Theatre Center
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nGianmarco Soresi is a New York-based stand-up comedian\, actor\, and creator known for his sharp societal observations\, spry energetic stage presence\, and deeply personal storytelling. He has quickly risen through the comedy ranks to become one of the most talked-about voices in the industry. \nGianmarco’s comedy blends intelligent social commentary with self-deprecating humor and theatrical flair. His unique background as both a comedian and actor gives his performances a dynamic quality that sets him apart from his peers. He has performed at major comedy festivals and venues across the country. \nThe Drama King Tour is Gianmarco’s most ambitious touring project to date\, having already sold out venues across the country including The Belasco in Los Angeles and multiple shows at San Jose Improv. The Hawaii Theatre Center stop is a highly anticipated addition to this acclaimed tour. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026 \nShow Time: 7:00 PM HST \nVenue: Hawaii Theatre Center\, 1130 Bethel Street\, Honolulu\, HI 96813 \nContent Note: Stand-up comedy for mature audiences. Please check venue policies for age restrictions. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Hawaii Theatre Center is one of Honolulu’s most historic and beloved performance venues\, located at 1130 Bethel Street in the heart of downtown Honolulu. Built in 1922\, this stunning Beaux-Arts theater has been beautifully restored and is listed on the National Register of Historic Places. \nThe Hawaii Theatre seats approximately 1\,400 guests and features a gorgeous ornate interior with excellent acoustics and sightlines from every seat. The venue’s grand architecture and intimate atmosphere create a truly special setting for live performances. \nLocated in downtown Honolulu\, the Hawaii Theatre Center is easily accessible from Waikiki and surrounding neighborhoods. Parking is available in nearby public parking structures\, and the venue is served by multiple bus routes. \nWhat to Expect\nGianmarco Soresi’s Drama King Tour at Hawaii Theatre Center promises to be one of the standout comedy events of the summer in Honolulu. The historic venue provides a stunning backdrop for Gianmarco’s theatrical\, high-energy performance style. \nExpect a full headline set featuring Gianmarco’s signature blend of sharp social commentary\, personal storytelling\, and theatrical comedy. His shows are known for their intelligence\, heart\, and ability to make audiences both think and laugh simultaneously. \nThis is a one-night-only event at one of Honolulu’s most iconic venues. Given the demand from his national tour\, tickets are expected to sell out well in advance. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $68 \nSecure your seats now through the official ticket link or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gianmarco-soresi-the-drama-king-tour-live-at-hawaii-theatre-center/
