SUMMARY:Kill Tony LIVE at Madison Square Garden
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nKill Tony LIVE at Madison Square Garden\nOne of the most electrifying live comedy podcast experiences in the world\, Kill Tony returns to the iconic Madison Square Garden in New York City for a massive one-night event on August 7\, 2026. Hosted by Tony Hinchcliffe\, Kill Tony is a weekly live podcast where unknown comedians get exactly 60 seconds to perform stand-up\, followed by feedback from Tony and a rotating panel of celebrity guests. At MSG\, expect a sold-out crowd\, surprise celebrity appearances\, and the raw\, unfiltered comedy that has made Kill Tony a global phenomenon. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Madison Square Garden\nAddress: 4 Pennsylvania Plaza\, New York\, NY 10001\nCapacity: ~20\,000\nParking: Available at MSG parking facilities and nearby garages\nAge Requirement: All ages (18+ recommended for content) \nAbout Kill Tony\nKill Tony is a weekly live podcast hosted by comedian Tony Hinchcliffe\, produced by Rooster Teeth and recorded live in Austin\, Texas — and now touring the world’s biggest arenas. The show features unknown comedians performing 60-second sets judged by Tony and celebrity guests\, creating unpredictable\, hilarious\, and often jaw-dropping moments. Kill Tony previously sold out Madison Square Garden and is back for another legendary night at The World’s Most Famous Arena. \nWhat to Expect\n\nTony Hinchcliffe hosting a live taping of the Kill Tony podcast\nUnknown comedians competing in 60-second stand-up sets\nSurprise celebrity guest appearances\nUnfiltered\, raw comedy in front of a massive MSG crowd\nAn electric\, one-of-a-kind live event experience\nTwo-night run at MSG (Aug 7 & 8) — each night features its own lineup\n\nVenue Information\nMadison Square Garden\, located at 4 Pennsylvania Plaza in Midtown Manhattan\, is the most famous arena in the world\, hosting over 300 events per year. With a capacity of approximately 20\,000\, MSG offers world-class amenities\, multiple food and beverage options\, and easy access via Penn Station and multiple subway lines. \nTicket Information\nOfficial tickets start at $605 and are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are also available through VividSeats. This is a two-night event (Aug 7 & 8) — tickets are sold separately per night. Availability is limited\, so secure your seats early. \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kill-tony-live-at-madison-square-garden/
