SUMMARY:Daniel Sloss: BITTER LIVE at The Wilbur
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nDaniel Sloss is one of the most exciting and critically acclaimed stand-up comedians working today. The Scottish comedian first burst onto the international scene with his Netflix specials Dark and Jigsaw — both of which became global sensations and are widely regarded as two of the best stand-up specials of the past decade. \nHis new show BITTER continues his tradition of darkly brilliant\, deeply personal\, and laugh-out-loud funny comedy. Daniel has a rare gift for taking the most uncomfortable subjects — love\, loss\, relationships\, and the human condition — and turning them into comedy that is both hilarious and genuinely moving. \nWith two sold-out nights at The Wilbur (Aug 7 and Aug 8)\, Daniel Sloss: BITTER is one of the hottest comedy tickets in Boston this summer. Don’t miss your chance to see one of the world’s best stand-up comedians live. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026 (Saturday August 8 show also available)\nTime: 7:30 PM ET\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nTickets from: $81\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most beloved and intimate comedy venues\, located in the heart of the Theater District at 246 Tremont Street. With a capacity of approximately 1\,000 guests\, The Wilbur offers an up-close and personal experience that is perfect for Daniel’s deeply personal and emotionally resonant performance style. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from every seat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, historic atmosphere that makes every show feel special. Originally built in 1914\, The Wilbur has been lovingly restored and is now one of the premier comedy destinations on the East Coast. \nParking is available at nearby garages in the Theater District\, and the venue is easily accessible via the MBTA Green and Orange Lines at Boylston and Back Bay stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a darkly brilliant\, deeply funny\, and emotionally resonant evening of stand-up comedy as Daniel Sloss brings BITTER to The Wilbur. This is a solo performance showcasing Daniel’s signature blend of dark humor\, personal storytelling\, and the kind of fearless comedy that has made him one of the most talked-about comedians in the world. \nRecommended for audiences 18 and older due to mature and dark content. Come ready for a show that will make you laugh\, think\, and feel all at once. \nTicket Information\nTickets from $81. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets via VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/daniel-sloss-bitter-live-at-the-wilbur/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA\, 2116
