SUMMARY:Joey Diaz: 62 & Still Slinging LIVE at Ovation Hall at Ocean Casino Resort
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJoey Diaz: 62 & Still Slinging LIVE at Ovation Hall\nJoey Diaz\, one of comedy’s most beloved and brutally honest voices\, brings his  tour LIVE to Ovation Hall at Ocean Casino Resort in Atlantic City on Friday\, August 7\, 2026. Known for his explosive storytelling and fearless delivery\, Joey Diaz is guaranteed to bring the house down. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026Time: 9:00 PM ETVenue: Ovation Hall at Ocean Casino ResortAddress: 500 Boardwalk\, Atlantic City\, NJ 08401Doors Open: 8:00 PM \nAbout Joey Diaz\nJoey Diaz is a stand-up comedian\, actor\, and podcast host best known for his long-running podcast The Church of What’s Happening Now and his frequent appearances on The Joe Rogan Experience. His debut Netflix special Trippin’ with Joey Diaz and his Billboard #1 comedy album cemented his status as one of the most authentic voices in stand-up. At 62\, Joey is still going strong and funnier than ever. \nWhat to Expect\n\nJoey Diaz’s raw\, unfiltered stand-up comedy\nHilarious personal stories from a life lived to the fullest\nExplosive delivery and crowd-pleasing energy\nOne of comedy’s most beloved cult figures performing live\nAn unforgettable Friday night in Atlantic City\n\nVenue Information\nOvation Hall at Ocean Casino Resort is Atlantic City’s premier entertainment venue at 500 Boardwalk\, featuring state-of-the-art sound and world-class dining and gaming nearby. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $50. Get your seats through official Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/joey-diaz-live-at-ovation-hall-at-ocean-casino-resort/
LOCATION:Ovation Hall at Ocean Casino Resort\, 500 Boardwalk\, Atlantic City\, NJ\, 8401\, United States Of America
